1
00:00:01,200 --> 00:00:04,400
Umer: Uff... subah ke chhe baj gaye!

2
00:00:14,600 --> 00:00:20,600
Umer: Assalam-o-alaikum guys, kaise hain aap sab? Aaj hum Karachi se Islamabad ja rahe hain!

3
00:00:21,600 --> 00:00:25,000
Umer: Ye dekhiye mera kamra... aur garmi bohat hai.

4
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,000
Umer: Pehle pankha on karte hain.

5
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:35,000
Umer: Ab packing — chaliye almari kholte hain.

6
00:00:36,400 --> 00:00:41,400
Umer: Ye rahe kapre — shirts, pants, aur mera travel pouch.

7
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:50,400
Umer: Ammi! Mera Travel Splash wala bag de dein, please!

8
00:00:51,400 --> 00:00:54,400
Ammi: Ye lo beta, tumhara bag.

9
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:57,400
Umer: Shukriya Ammi!

10
00:01:10,400 --> 00:01:15,000
Umer: Hello Rashid Bhai, Assalam-o-alaikum! Revo le kar aa jayein — aath baje nikalna hai.

11
00:01:15,600 --> 00:01:19,400
Driver: Walaikum Assalam Umer bhai! Bas aadhe ghante mein pohanch raha hoon.

12
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:31,400
Umer: Kitchen se khushboo aa rahi hai — Ammi paratha bana rahi hain!

13
00:01:33,000 --> 00:01:35,600
Umer: Ammi, aaj Islamabad ja rahe hain.

14
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:38,400
Ammi: Achha? Tayari ho gayi?

15
00:01:38,800 --> 00:01:41,400
Umer: Ji, bas ab nikalna hai.

16
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:45,000
Ammi: Lo, garam garam paratha khao.

17
00:01:51,400 --> 00:01:55,000
Ammi: Waise tumhari ye nayi Aprox AI kya cheez hai?

18
00:01:55,600 --> 00:02:02,600
Umer: Ammi, Aprox AI launch ho gayi hai. Aap is se sawal kar sakti hain, research kar sakti hain — Urdu mein bhi.

19
00:02:03,000 --> 00:02:06,400
Ammi: Achha! Phir to main is se recipe poochungi.

20
00:02:06,800 --> 00:02:10,000
Umer: Bilkul Ammi, aap ke phone mein install kar dunga.

21
00:02:12,400 --> 00:02:14,600
Umer: Lagta hai Rashid Bhai aa gaye!

22
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:18,400
Ammi: Safar mein khayal rakhna — Fi Amanillah, beta.

23
00:02:26,400 --> 00:02:30,000
Umer: Dekhiye — Rashid Bhai aa gaye hain, aur Revo bilkul ready hai!

24
00:02:32,400 --> 00:02:34,800
Driver: Assalam-o-alaikum Umer bhai!

25
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:37,600
Umer: Walaikum Assalam Rashid Bhai! Kaise hain?

26
00:02:37,800 --> 00:02:39,600
Driver: Alhamdulillah. Bag peeche rakh dein.

27
00:02:46,800 --> 00:02:51,000
Umer: Chaliye guys, safar shuru! Pehle DHA ki galiyon se nikalenge.

28
00:02:51,600 --> 00:02:54,000
Ammi: Allah Hafiz beta!

29
00:03:01,000 --> 00:03:05,000
Umer: Ye hai DHA ka main road — Khayaban-e-Ittehad.

30
00:03:06,600 --> 00:03:11,000
Umer: Dekhiye — chai ka dhaba, paratha point, aur Aprox Technology ka banner!

31
00:03:21,000 --> 00:03:24,400
Driver: Signal laal hai — yahan se right lekar Korangi Road.

32
00:03:25,000 --> 00:03:29,000
Umer: Zebra crossing par log guzar rahe hain — sab apni baari par.

33
00:03:41,000 --> 00:03:45,400
Umer: Korangi Road — yahan workshops aur gaariyon ke showroom hain.

34
00:03:47,000 --> 00:03:51,000
Driver: Aage FTC flyover se Shahrah-e-Faisal par chadhenge.

35
00:03:55,200 --> 00:03:58,800
Driver: Yaar, gaari mein kuch masla aa gaya hai.

36
00:04:00,400 --> 00:04:03,800
Umer: Bonnet se dhuaan! Rashid Bhai, kinare par laga dein.

37
00:04:05,800 --> 00:04:12,200
Umer: Yaar, kisi ko call karne se behtar hai Aprox AI se poochte hain. Aprox AI ka Driver Mode on karte hain.

38
00:04:30,800 --> 00:04:37,400
Umer: Aprox AI keh raha hai — engine thanda hone dein, garam radiator mat kholein, aur workshop sirf 650 meter par hai.

39
00:04:37,800 --> 00:04:40,800
Driver: Wah Umer bhai! Chalo, dheere dheere workshop chalte hain.

40
00:04:48,400 --> 00:04:52,400
Umer: Ustad ji, jaldi kijiye please — meri flight ka time ho raha hai!

41
00:04:53,000 --> 00:04:57,600
Mechanic: Bas paanch minute sahib. Radiator ka pipe leak tha — naya laga raha hoon.

42
00:05:01,800 --> 00:05:05,800
Umer: Dosto, sach mein tension ho rahi hai... ghari dekhte reh jao!

43
00:05:06,800 --> 00:05:10,200
Driver: Umer bhai, waqt hai abhi — pareshan na hon.

44
00:05:14,400 --> 00:05:17,200
Mechanic: Lo ji, gaari bilkul theek!

45
00:05:17,600 --> 00:05:20,400
Umer: Shukriya ustad ji! Kitne paise?

46
00:05:20,600 --> 00:05:22,600
Mechanic: Bas aath sau rupay.

47
00:05:22,800 --> 00:05:25,800
Umer: Yeh lijiye. Chalo Rashid Bhai, jaldi airport!

48
00:05:26,800 --> 00:05:32,200
Umer: Dosto, gaari theek ho gayi! Ab Shahrah-e-Faisal par aage — Karsaz aur Drigh Road se.

49
00:05:33,800 --> 00:05:37,400
Driver: Woh dekhiye sign — Jinnah International Airport, Star Gate se left.

50
00:05:51,200 --> 00:05:55,800
Umer: Ye raha Star Gate! Ab Airport Road — airport bilkul qareeb hai.

51
00:06:11,400 --> 00:06:14,800
Guard: Assalam o Alaikum. Ticket aur shanakhti card dikhayein.

52
00:06:15,200 --> 00:06:18,200
Umer: Yeh lijiye — Karachi se Islamabad, aaj ki flight.

53
00:06:19,000 --> 00:06:22,000
Guard: Theek hai. Gaari ki checking hogi.

54
00:06:29,000 --> 00:06:31,400
Guard: Sab theek hai — jaayein!

55
00:06:33,400 --> 00:06:38,000
Umer: Dosto, departure upar hai aur arrival neeche — hum upar ja rahe hain!

56
00:06:43,000 --> 00:06:47,000
Umer: Woh raha Jinnah International Airport!

57
00:06:53,800 --> 00:06:56,800
Driver: Allah Hafiz Umer bhai, safar mubarak!

58
00:06:57,000 --> 00:06:59,400
Umer: Shukriya Rashid Bhai, Allah Hafiz!

59
00:07:06,000 --> 00:07:07,800
Checker: Ticket please.

60
00:07:08,200 --> 00:07:10,800
Umer: Ji, ye lijiye — mobile par hai.

61
00:07:12,600 --> 00:07:15,400
Checker: Theek hai, andar tashreef le jayein.

62
00:07:16,000 --> 00:07:19,400
Umer: Ye dekhein — hum airport ke andar aa gaye hain!

63
00:07:24,600 --> 00:07:26,400
Agent: Assalam o Alaikum! Aap ka CNIC aur ticket, please.

64
00:07:26,500 --> 00:07:28,000
Agent: Yeh rahi aap ki boarding pass. Safar mubarak!

65
00:07:28,200 --> 00:07:31,200
Umer: Bohat shukriya! Dosto, bag drop ho gaya — ab security.

66
00:07:31,600 --> 00:07:34,000
Umer: Camera tray mein — security check zaroori hai.

67
00:07:36,600 --> 00:07:38,200
Officer: Theek hai, aage chalein.

68
00:07:40,000 --> 00:07:41,600
Umer: Camera wapas mil gaya! Ab lounge ki taraf.

69
00:07:50,600 --> 00:07:54,000
Umer: Ek burger, fries aur ek chai, please.

70
00:07:54,400 --> 00:07:57,000
Staff: Ji sir, abhi lijiye!

71
00:08:02,600 --> 00:08:06,000
Bilal: Arey Umer! Tum bhi Islamabad ja rahe ho?

72
00:08:06,400 --> 00:08:11,200
Umer: Haan yaar! Raaste mein gaari kharab ho gayi thi, bas abhi pohancha hoon.

73
00:08:11,600 --> 00:08:15,200
Hamza: Shukar hai pohanch gaye! Chalo, araam se nashta karo.

74
00:08:16,000 --> 00:08:19,200
Umer: Yeh burger to zabardast hai, yaar!

75
00:08:22,600 --> 00:08:26,600
Announcement: Mohtaram musafiron, Islamabad jane wali parwaz ki boarding shuru ho chuki hai.

76
00:08:26,800 --> 00:08:30,800
Announcement: Baraye meharbani gate number 5 ki taraf tashreef le jayen. Shukriya.

77
00:08:31,200 --> 00:08:34,000
Umer: Chalo yaar, boarding shuru!

78
00:08:44,600 --> 00:08:47,000
Umer: Boarding shuru ho gayi — Gate 5 ki taraf chalte hain!

79
00:08:47,600 --> 00:08:49,200
GateAgent: Boarding pass, please.

80
00:08:49,400 --> 00:08:50,800
Umer: Ji, yeh lijiye.

81
00:08:51,200 --> 00:08:53,000
GateAgent: Shukriya sir, tashreef le jayein.

82
00:08:54,000 --> 00:08:57,200
Umer: Dosto, yeh jet bridge seedha jahaz ke darwaze tak jata hai!

83
00:09:01,000 --> 00:09:03,800
Crew: Assalam o Alaikum, khush aamdeed! Aap ki seat 12A hai.

84
00:09:04,000 --> 00:09:05,600
Umer: Walaikum Assalam, shukriya!

85
00:09:07,000 --> 00:09:09,200
Pilot: Assalam o Alaikum, welcome aboard!

86
00:09:09,400 --> 00:09:11,600
Umer: Walaikum Assalam, Captain sahab!

87
00:09:12,800 --> 00:09:16,200
Umer: Dosto, yeh dekhiye — cockpit! Ab apni seat dhoondte hain.

88
00:09:18,400 --> 00:09:21,000
CrewM: Sir, aap ki seat 12A — window seat, yeh rahi.

89
00:09:21,400 --> 00:09:22,600
Umer: Shukriya!

90
00:09:23,200 --> 00:09:27,600
Umer: Dosto, seat 12A — window seat mil gayi! Bilkul wing ke saath.

91
00:09:28,800 --> 00:09:32,200
Umer: Bahar dekhiye — Jinnah Terminal, aur hamara jahaz tayyar hai.

92
00:09:33,300 --> 00:09:37,000
Umer: Seat belt bandh — jahaz runway ki taraf ja raha hai!

93
00:09:37,600 --> 00:09:41,600
Pilot: Cabin crew, takeoff ke liye tayyar ho jayein.

94
00:09:44,800 --> 00:09:47,600
Umer: Takeoff... Bismillah!

95
00:09:53,200 --> 00:09:56,400
Umer: Wheels up — hum hawa mein hain!

96
00:09:59,200 --> 00:10:02,400
Umer: Karachi neeche reh gaya — ab Islamabad ki taraf!

97
00:10:03,400 --> 00:10:07,400
Umer: Dekhiye dosto — baadalon ke upar kya nazara hai!

98
00:10:08,400 --> 00:10:12,200
Umer: Aur ab... lunch ka waqt ho gaya hai!

99
00:10:13,200 --> 00:10:16,200
CrewM: Sir, lunch — chicken biryani ya sandwich?

100
00:10:16,400 --> 00:10:18,400
Umer: Biryani please, aur paani.

101
00:10:18,800 --> 00:10:20,400
CrewM: Ji zaroor, yeh lijiye.

102
00:10:21,800 --> 00:10:25,800
Umer: Wah — biryani zabardast hai! Flight mein bhi ghar jaisa khana.

103
00:10:27,200 --> 00:10:30,400
Umer: Thori der mein Islamabad, InshaAllah!

104
00:10:31,200 --> 00:10:35,200
Pilot: Khawateen o hazraat, hum Islamabad mein landing ke liye tayyar hain.

105
00:10:36,000 --> 00:10:40,400
Umer: Dosto, neeche dekhiye — Islamabad! Peeche Margalla Hills.

106
00:10:41,800 --> 00:10:44,800
Umer: Runway saamne hai... landing gear neeche.

107
00:10:48,800 --> 00:10:51,400
Umer: Touchdown! Smooth landing!

108
00:10:53,200 --> 00:10:56,800
Umer: Alhamdulillah — hum Islamabad pohanch gaye!

109
00:10:57,800 --> 00:11:01,400
Umer: Islamabad pohanch gaye! Ab bas apna bag mil jaye...

110
00:11:04,200 --> 00:11:07,200
Umer: Woh raha — mera Travel Splash bag!

111
00:11:14,200 --> 00:11:17,200
Umer: Dosto, yeh hai Islamabad International Airport!

112
00:11:17,400 --> 00:11:21,000
Umer: Kitna bada, saaf aur khoobsurat hai — maza aa gaya!

113
00:11:21,800 --> 00:11:25,800
Umer: Bahar se dekhiye — Islamabad airport ki lehrati hui chhat!

114
00:11:29,800 --> 00:11:33,400
Umer: Meri Corolla Grande parking mein khadi hai — chalo!

115
00:11:41,800 --> 00:11:45,200
Umer: Bag andar, seat belt laga li — Bismillah!

116
00:11:49,800 --> 00:11:54,200
Umer: Ab seedha Murree Road ki taraf — Islamabad ki sair!

117
00:11:54,600 --> 00:11:59,200
Umer: Srinagar Highway se Faisal Avenue — saamne Faisal Masjid!

118
00:12:00,200 --> 00:12:04,200
Umer: Islamabad ki sarkein — saaf, hari bhari, aur peeche Margalla!

119
00:12:05,600 --> 00:12:10,000
Umer: Dosto, hum pohanch gaye hain... mere peeche dekhiye!

120
00:12:13,000 --> 00:12:17,200
Umer: Yeh hai Faisal Masjid... SubhanAllah, kitni khoobsurat!

121
00:12:19,200 --> 00:12:23,200
Umer: Chaar minar aur khaime jaisa hall — Margalla ke daaman mein.

122
00:12:24,800 --> 00:12:28,800
Umer: Faizabad se Murree Road — upar Metro Bus chal rahi hai!

123
00:12:40,200 --> 00:12:44,800
Umer: Dekhiye dosto — Islamabad sirf hara bhara nahi, yahan bari bari imaratein aur malls bhi hain!

124
00:12:45,200 --> 00:12:48,800
Umer: Aur har jagah Aprox AI aur Next Group ke banners!

125
00:12:54,800 --> 00:12:58,400
Umer: Signal laal — zebra crossing par log guzar rahe hain.

126
00:13:08,400 --> 00:13:12,800
Umer: Ab Murree Road par Hotel 99 — aaj raat wahin qayam hai!

127
00:13:15,100 --> 00:13:19,100
Umer: Lo ji dosto — Murree Road par Hotel 99 aa gaya!

128
00:13:22,500 --> 00:13:24,900
Staff: Assalam o Alaikum sir, khush aamdeed!

129
00:13:25,100 --> 00:13:26,900
Umer: Walaikum Assalam!

130
00:13:29,300 --> 00:13:32,900
Reception: Sir, aap ki booking confirm hai — Room 305, yeh raha key card.

131
00:13:33,300 --> 00:13:35,300
Umer: Bohat shukriya!

132
00:13:38,900 --> 00:13:42,900
Umer: Dosto, lobby bohat khoobsurat hai — chalo room dekhte hain.

133
00:13:45,300 --> 00:13:49,700
Umer: Yeh raha hamara room — saaf, aaramdeh, aur bara bed!

134
00:13:50,900 --> 00:13:54,700
Umer: Aur khirki se raat ki roshniyan — kya nazara hai.

135
00:13:57,700 --> 00:14:02,900
Umer: Aaj ka safar bohat lamba tha — Karachi se Islamabad, Alhamdulillah.

136
00:14:03,300 --> 00:14:09,700
Umer: Aaj ka vlog yahin end karte hain... Kal subah InshaAllah hum log Murree ki taraf nikalenge.

137
00:14:10,100 --> 00:14:13,900
Umer: Video pasand aaye to like, share aur subscribe zaroor karein. Allah Hafiz!
